createWizardIntro=Let's create an event for this community. I'll ask a few short questions, show you a preview, and publish only after you confirm. Type `back` to change the previous answer or `cancel` to stop.
createWizardAskDate=**When should it start?**\nSend the date and local time as `YYYY-MM-DD H:mm`, for example `2026-12-05 19:00`.
createWizardAskTimezone=**Which time zone?**\nCurrent default: `{zone}`. Send an IANA zone, a UTC/GMT offset, or `default`.
createWizardAskLimit=**Attendee limit?**\nCurrent: {current}. Send a number from 1 to 1000, or `none` for no limit. You can also leave this blank.
createWizardAskRepeat=**Repeat this event?**\nCurrent: {current}. Send `once`, `daily:4`, `weekly:4`, or `monthly:4`. Leave blank for once.
createWizardAskDuration=**Approximate duration in minutes?**\nCurrent community default: {duration}. Send 15–1440, or leave blank to use the default.
createWizardAskNotify=**Send a DM when the event starts?**\nCurrent: {current}. Reply `yes` or `no`; default is no.
createWizardAskTitle=**Event title?**\nCurrent: {current}. Use 1–100 characters.
createWizardAskDescription=**Description?**\nCurrent: {current}. Send up to 700 characters, or `-` to leave it empty.
